DISCUSSION NOTES:
- Blocker B-01 (Dataset Coverage): ML Lead confirmed that the current validation set lacks representative rain, glare, and night camera frames. Decision: Allocate 4 engineering days to ingest 2,500 labeled adverse frames before model acceptance signoff.
- Blocker B-02 (OCR Accuracy): OCR Engineer reported plate text accuracy sits at 82% against target 90%. Resolution: Apply bilateral filtering, plate perspective correction, and route confidence < 0.85 to human review.
- Blocker B-03 (API Contract): Backend Lead presented OpenAPI v2 schema. Frontend lead requested standardized evidence trace identifiers. Target signoff date: 10 October 2026.

